<title>NEW ZEALAND: Kimbyr has 86.88 pct of Underground.</title>
<headline>Kimbyr has 86.88 pct of Underground.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just Jeans Unit Kimbyr Investments said on Monday it had 86.88 percent of Underground Fashions Ltd.  </p>
<p>Kimbyr is offering 33.5 NZ cents per Underground share in a stand in the market for Underground. The offer closes on February 7. -- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
